  "title": "HTTP/3: Clear the Info column as intended",
  "description": "Inside dissect_http3, the http3 dissector has already been called and\nso \"http3\" is always inside the list of layers, so as written it's a\nno-op and the Info column is never cleared. Change this to what\nis intended, and clear the column if this is the first HTTP/3 STREAM\nin the frame by checking proto_get_layer_num for proto_http3 instead.",
